From Agustin.Lobo at ija.csic.es  Tue Oct 16 12:51:28 2007
From: Agustin.Lobo at ija.csic.es (Agustin Lobo)
Date: Wed Nov 14 16:58:18 2007
Subject: [STATSGRASS] "Neighbourhood modifier" from r.mapcalc in R?
